 "short_name": "uMngeni",
 "_doc": "uMngeni Local Municipality (Howick) pre-printed form: the text layer carries only values - the municipality's VAT number 4240102774 alone on a line, then one header value line (account | statement date | posting date | invoice number | VAT total), unlabeled address lines, the ledger (unallocated receipts block, then Balance brought forward / Receipts / Transfers / '** Total monthly', then 'Elect:COMM Basic 1 <ex> <VAT> <amount>' and 'Elect:COMM Consumption|ConsOld on <kWh> <c/kWh> <VAT> <amount>', occasionally a 'Sundries ADMINISTRATION' credit), a newsletter, and a meter row 'G E <meter> <old> <new> <code> <kWh> dd/mm-dd/mm'. Amount is VAT-inclusive; ex = amount - VAT. total_ex_vat_r = all Elect: lines ex VAT; standard_r = consumption, other_r = basic. kWh from the consumption line (equals the meter row on 12/12); readings and dd/mm reading period from the meter row. site_name left blank: the address lines carry no labels and it is not clear which one is the site. Fingerprint: VAT 4240102774 + 'Total monthly'. IDENTITY umg_ident_ex = Total monthly - brought forward - receipts - transfers - non-electricity lines - header VAT total: 0.00 on 12/12 (the header VAT total also equals the electricity VAT on 12/12). Checked on 12 bills.",
 "fingerprint": {
  "all": [
   "4240102774",
   "Total monthly"
  ],
  "any": [],
  "reject_if_text": []
 },
